# ==========================================================================
# 這個 repo 是「公開」的（github.com/Steven8925/st8925lab，visibility: public），
# 而且整個工作目錄同時就是 Cloudflare Pages 的發佈來源。因此任何被 commit 的
# 檔案會同時出現在兩個公開位置，且 git 歷史無法真正刪除。
#
# This repo is PUBLIC (github.com/Steven8925/st8925lab), and the working
# directory doubles as the Cloudflare Pages publish root. Anything committed
# is exposed in two public places at once, and git history cannot truly
# un-publish it.
#
# 之前沒有這個檔案 —— 也就是說一次 `git add .` 就會把下列筆記檔連同其中的
# 正式密鑰推上公開 repo。新增於 2026-08-14 覆核時。
# This file did not exist before: a single `git add .` would have pushed the
# notes files below — including a live production secret — to the public repo.
# Added during the 2026-08-14 review.
# ==========================================================================

# 部署過程的個人筆記檔，內含正式環境密鑰／示範帳密，不得進版控。
# Personal deployment scratch notes containing live secrets / demo credentials.
render installation guide.txt
手機密碼.txt

# 防禦性規則：任何 .env 都不進版控（source/.gitignore 已擋一次，這裡再擋一次）。
# Defensive: never commit any .env (source/.gitignore already covers its own).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
